    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462015448473600
    m_Localized: Whoa, is this a battle? Just like in my favorite card games!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462219476197376
    m_Localized: A battle? This is just an experiment. Your task is to understand
      the properties of the elements and use them against your opponent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462308525465600
    m_Localized: An experiment?! His eyes are glowing like a raid boss!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462461382680576
    m_Localized: "Focus. This is your first fight \u2014 let\u2019s see how well
      you follow my guidance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462565384642560
    m_Localized: "Alright then, let\u2019s see what I\u2019ve got!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462830229774336
    m_Localized: This one looks tough... Do I stand a chance?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463085729996800
    m_Localized: "There\u2019s always a chance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463125781405696
    m_Localized: "Chemistry teaches us \u2014 even weak elements can become powerful
      in the right combination."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463217259175936
    m_Localized: "Why are the enemies so aggressive? Don\u2019t they have anything
      better to do?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463290571415552
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s part of the simulation, Pasha. Like a catalyst in a reaction
      \u2014 they\u2019re here to push you to grow stronger."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463602468249600
    m_Localized: "Whew\u2026 I think I\u2019m getting used to these battles."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463674371203072
    m_Localized: Getting used to it is good. But stay focused. In chemistry, one
      overlooked element can ruin the entire reaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464014231461888
    m_Localized: "Another battle\u2026 This opponent looks familiar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464100764147712
    m_Localized: Of course they do. You think enemies will always be new?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464136113741824
    m_Localized: No, Pasha. Real progress means overcoming old challenges in new
      ways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464225460805632
    m_Localized: This enemy feels... strange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464279152091136
    m_Localized: Strange enemies remind me of rare isotopes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464318171701248
    m_Localized: "They\u2019re rare, but dangerously unpredictable."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464389357428736
    m_Localized: The farther we go, the stronger the enemies get.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464447108800512
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s the law of progress. In chemistry, overcoming a strong
      bond requires greater energy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464499386605568
    m_Localized: Dmitry Ivanovich, do you want to beat them too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464601677291520
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m a chemist, not a warrior. But if victory brings us closer
      to the exit, I\u2019ll do my part."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464660821172224
    m_Localized: Here we go again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464891902156800
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve seen this one before\u2026 Time to try something new."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464947837394944
    m_Localized: Oh Pasha, you know this is all part of the game. And a true game
      never hands you the answers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464996403240960
    m_Localized: "You have to find your own way \u2014 even if it means breaking
      old habits!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465044423827456
    m_Localized: "How many times must I say it? You can\u2019t go through life without
      understanding the basics!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465104649838592
    m_Localized: "Without foundational knowledge \u2014 without theory \u2014 you\u2019ll
      never defeat real enemies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465167828639744
    m_Localized: "Oh right, the classic theory... But Pasha, you don\u2019t want
      to end up like Dmitry, stuck in the past, do you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465219355664384
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s better to experiment, find your own path, and break free
      from outdated methods."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465290344259584
    m_Localized: "I don\u2019t reject the old or the new. I think the answer is in
      combining both."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465388641968128
    m_Localized: These battles are becoming part of everyday life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465453553016832
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s how progress works. You move forward, even when you
      don\u2019t notice it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465573505916928
    m_Localized: "I think I\u2019m starting to get it. So chemistry\u2026 is like
      a story about bears?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465646465835008
    m_Localized: Only with elements?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465701440577536
    m_Localized: Each of us is unique, but we all exist in one world and interact
      with one another?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465779534323712
    m_Localized: One billion points to you, Pasha!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465819468292096
    m_Localized: "Every element is unique in its own way. And yes \u2014 they interact
      and influence each other."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465857728733184
    m_Localized: "Think of reactions between metals and non-metals \u2014 how molecules
      come together to form something greater."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466211035930624
    m_Localized: "We\u2019re all different, but sooner or later, we need to find
      common ground."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466470927589376
    m_Localized: "Just like in any developed society \u2014 like, say, people."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466711324123136
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s complicated\u2026 but fascinating."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466782161723392
    m_Localized: "So how do you know which elements will work together \u2014 and
      which will end in disaster?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466839523024896
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s exactly the point."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466914596872192
    m_Localized: You have to study. You have to understand their nature. Knowledge
      is the key.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466968057470976
    m_Localized: "But remember, it\u2019s not just about knowing how elements work
      \u2014 it\u2019s about sensing how they might react in the most unexpected
      moment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 467035078254592
    m_Localized: "I get it. Just like in life \u2014 seek harmony, but be ready when
      things go off script."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 467077495250944
    m_Localized: Excellent, Pasha. You're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 467162861920256
    m_Localized: But before you decide how to interact with this world, there are
      still a few trials ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 468022786514944
    m_Localized: "Whoa! That\u2019s a whole set of cards!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 468141418209280
    m_Localized: How do I pick the right one?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 468223328772096
    m_Localized: "Remember, Pasha \u2014 it\u2019s not just about power, it\u2019s
      about synergy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469108092035072
    m_Localized: Sometimes the quietest choice turns out to be the game-changer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469194326925312
    m_Localized: Whoa! Why are there so many?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469255224025088
    m_Localized: I kinda want to grab them all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469295233490944
    m_Localized: Greed is a poor advisor, young bear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469389634691072
    m_Localized: Think about how these elements will help you later. Sometimes the
      win is in quality, not quantity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469444735262720
    m_Localized: "Dmitry Ivanovich, be honest \u2014 what would you pick?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469501651968000
    m_Localized: "Me? Naturally, I\u2019d choose what serves science \u2014 for only
      science truly matters."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469561294970880
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s obvious, Pasha. You wouldn\u2019t waste your time on
      something trivial, would you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469674683785216
    m_Localized: "But in the end, it\u2019s your game \u2014 your choice."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469721987145728
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll help, of course, but surely you understand that the right
      path follows scientific principles \u2014 not mere entertainment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 469809413218304
    m_Localized: "Still, I\u2019m certain you\u2019ll make the correct decision.
      Naturally."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470079455092736
    m_Localized: Why do these elements look so different?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470177983488000
    m_Localized: Every element has its own personality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470216864686080
    m_Localized: "Take Sodium \u2014 wildly reactive. And Helium? Calm and carefree."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470251698380800
    m_Localized: Get to know them, and the choice will become clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470315867037696
    m_Localized: More cards, Pasha? Good choice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470361647865856
    m_Localized: "But remember \u2014 even the smallest element can surprise you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470401816715264
    m_Localized: "I wonder what combos we\u2019ll see this time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470498671583232
    m_Localized: "Haha \u2014 it all depends on how you use them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470572742991872
    m_Localized: Be ready for surprises.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470657082056704
    m_Localized: Why does gold look so awesome?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470721317822464
    m_Localized: "Oh, Pasha \u2014 because it\u2019s gold!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470759687315456
    m_Localized: "In games, it always sparkles, lures you in, and screams: \u201CPick
      me, I\u2019m the most valuable!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470797926785024
    m_Localized: "In reality, gold is just another metal \u2014 shiny, sure, but
      not always useful."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470835784572928
    m_Localized: Sometimes the dullest elements hide the greatest power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470894844567552
    m_Localized: The longer I stare, the harder it is to choose...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470941678166016
    m_Localized: Struggle is part of growth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 470976105013248
    m_Localized: You're not as impulsive as you were in the beginning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471010376671232
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d say you\u2019re starting to think like a chemist."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471193395126272
    m_Localized: Time to pick cards again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471258738188288
    m_Localized: "Honestly, sometimes I don\u2019t even see how this ties into real
      chemistry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471299368411136
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s the whole point, Pasha."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471344041943040
    m_Localized: "Chemistry isn\u2019t just formulas and tables."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471379035021312
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s about solving problems \u2014 and the courage to experiment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471443493085184
    m_Localized: "You\u2019re here to try things, not memorize them!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471485536788480
    m_Localized: "Experimenting is good, but card games don\u2019t replace a proper
      education!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471526762602496
    m_Localized: "True knowledge takes discipline \u2014 not just random choices."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471576897118208
    m_Localized: "Still, Dmitry, the world\u2019s changing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471628164096000
    m_Localized: Games help us see science from a new angle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471681679220736
    m_Localized: "You know it yourself: sometimes to truly understand something,
      you need to step into the unknown \u2014 not just sit with textbooks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471782413819904
    m_Localized: Hey, no fighting! I still need to pick the cards that'll help me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471827909435392
    m_Localized: "Since it\u2019s an experiment\u2026 maybe I should just trust my
      gut?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471868883591168
    m_Localized: "You\u2019re a billion percent right, Pasha!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471919999574016
    m_Localized: Sometimes the best choice is the one you made yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472147997745152
    m_Localized: Choosing feels easier now than before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472210580955136
    m_Localized: "That shows how much you\u2019ve grown."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472265316622336
    m_Localized: "As a chemist, you\u2019re learning a simple truth: not all that
      glitters is gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472321591599104
    m_Localized: "You know, Dmitry Ivanovich, I think I\u2019m ready to teach a chemistry
      class!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472380651593728
    m_Localized: Ha! Then start with the formula for water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472422917595136
    m_Localized: "Jokes aside \u2014 if you truly learn to think like a scientist,
      I\u2019ll be proud."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472484775190528
    m_Localized: Oooh, ready to pick your new allies, Pasha?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472552295096320
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ve noticed, right? Each one feels like a wild, unique
      personality!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472589519544320
    m_Localized: "Yeah! Elements aren\u2019t just elements \u2014 they\u2019re like
      heroes, ready to fight for you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472633513598976
    m_Localized: Hmm, yeah, but why anime characters? Why not just... bears?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472668934496256
    m_Localized: "Because anime isn\u2019t just drawings \u2014 it\u2019s spirit!
      It\u2019s power, energy, it\u2019s EVERYTHING!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472717466787840
    m_Localized: "And chemical elements\u2026 they also have traits, their own essence!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472771585892352
    m_Localized: If you see them as anime characters, you start to understand them
      like real PEOPLE!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472810987184128
    m_Localized: "They burn, they explode, they fall in love, they stir your soul!
      And they\u2019ll be your allies, Pasha!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472848542982144
    m_Localized: Okay then. In that case, I choose...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 473221974450176
    m_Localized: This place looks unusual. What am I supposed to do here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 473494432243712
    m_Localized: Here, you can combine elements into compounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 473529819586560
    m_Localized: Think about what could lead to a useful result.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 473873421164544
    m_Localized: "I think I\u2019m starting to get how this works."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 473921261395968
    m_Localized: "The key is to not fear experimentation. Many discoveries were accidents
      \u2014 with persistence."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 473958188048384
    m_Localized: "And don\u2019t forget the recipes I gave you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474034151088128
    m_Localized: What if I mix the wrong things?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474085501952000
    m_Localized: In chemistry, mistakes are part of the process.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474131572187136
    m_Localized: Sometimes failures lead to the greatest breakthroughs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474194247671808
    m_Localized: I like creating something new.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474253236363264
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s... inspiring."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474364137955328
    m_Localized: The world of chemistry is opening up to you. Welcome!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474519570472960
    m_Localized: I wonder... is there a limit to how many compounds I can make?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474562050383872
    m_Localized: Only your imagination can limit you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474604786147328
    m_Localized: Chemistry is an endless field of possibilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474665280593920
    m_Localized: Now I get how order comes from chaos.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474730321666048
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ve grasped the essence of chemistry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474771962716160
    m_Localized: Keep experimenting, and even more secrets will be revealed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474872634400768
    m_Localized: "So, Pasha \u2014 a choice lies before you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474935221805056
    m_Localized: "But remember \u2014 the game isn\u2019t just about combining elements,
      it\u2019s your chance to find your own path."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 474988355248128
    m_Localized: "Why follow someone else\u2019s rules when you can make your own?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 475394443567104
    m_Localized: Here we go again with his little games...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 475489809457152
    m_Localized: Do you seriously think you can learn everything through this kind
      of entertainment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 475804730384384
    m_Localized: "Arno and I aren\u2019t even talking about the same thing!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 475988046635008
    m_Localized: "At the Bear Academy, it\u2019s different \u2014 we get real foundational
      knowledge."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476048926957568
    m_Localized: "They teach logical thinking \u2014 not just decision-making based
      on emotion and luck!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476095248850944
    m_Localized: "They teach logical thinking \u2014 not just decision-making based
      on emotion and luck!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476188446285824
    m_Localized: Yeah, sure, Dmitry. All those academic methods and boring lectures...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476232473894912
    m_Localized: "But here\u2019s the question: how many bears ever actually used
      that knowledge for real?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476301784768512
    m_Localized: "But games and simulations can teach them in action \u2014 in real
      situations."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476343069302784
    m_Localized: Your old academy just raises bears who follow blueprints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476383250735104
    m_Localized: So what are you saying? That makes you a better scientist?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476466113404928
    m_Localized: "You don\u2019t even understand how deep real science goes! Without
      strict methods, nothing will work!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476641875714048
    m_Localized: I discovered this mechanic in the game myself, but I still think
      it's unscientific.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476687081922560
    m_Localized: We can't just combine elements like in some kind of simulator.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476729326952448
    m_Localized: "In real chemistry, things are much more complicated\u2014and you
      know that, Arno."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476765595099136
    m_Localized: That's exactly the point, Dmitry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476802404311040
    m_Localized: The goal isn't just to combine them, but to understand how the elements
      interact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476839024779264
    m_Localized: "It's like your lab experience\u2014only here, you're the one in
      control."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476915101065216
    m_Localized: Maybe there's something to that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 476954561077248
    m_Localized: Still, I wish there was more theory than gameplay practice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477054100299776
    m_Localized: Maybe I really am too stuck in the old ways...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477108638834688
    m_Localized: After all, Pasha, it's all about seeing the results with your own
      eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477143384449024
    m_Localized: Exactly, Dmitry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477180239798272
    m_Localized: "Science and games aren't opposites\u2014they're two ways of understanding
      the world and its patterns."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477216621191168
    m_Localized: Combining those two approaches can be far more effective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477255250731008
    m_Localized: That's true. When I see how the cards interact, I realize it's more
      than just a game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477287693672448
    m_Localized: "It's brain training\u2014finding solutions, just like in real life."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477328474890240
    m_Localized: A billion points to you, young bear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477385605505024
    m_Localized: Dmitry Ivanovich, this is incredible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477435052154880
    m_Localized: Every combination is unique, but I feel like I've mastered it 100%!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477473635557376
    m_Localized: You've taken a huge step forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477506158190592
    m_Localized: "But remember: science is endless\u2014there's always something
      new to learn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477619521839104
    m_Localized: Time to put your skills to the test, Pavel!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477746202402816
    m_Localized: What the...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477791622520832
    m_Localized: "Hey, I just wanted to try this old console! Now what\u2014I'm inside
      the game?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477835570438144
    m_Localized: Hmm... And who might you be, young bear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477879551909888
    m_Localized: I'm Pasha! And who are you? And where even are we?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477923390775296
    m_Localized: Dmitry Ivanovich. Scientist, bioengineer, chemist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477962653655040
    m_Localized: And where we are... Well, long story. You're in a simulation, and
      unless you want to stay stuck here forever, you'll have to give it your all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478000737935360
    m_Localized: A simulation? I'm in a video game?! Wait a sec... And how did *you*
      get here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478038318899200
    m_Localized: "Wish I knew myself. One thing's clear though \u2014 the only way
      out is with your help."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478088675713024
    m_Localized: With my help? Don't tell me you can't play games yourself?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478177645289472
    m_Localized: Young bear, I studied at the Academy, not on game consoles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478220959866880
    m_Localized: But I do know a thing or two. This game is built around chemical
      elements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478256233963520
    m_Localized: My job is to explain their properties. Yours is to use them wisely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478294947389440
    m_Localized: Alright, sounds like a plan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478332582879232
    m_Localized: Though it still feels kind of insane to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478372856586240
    m_Localized: Get used to it, Pavel. This is just the beginning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478488518713344
    m_Localized: The water looks so clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478574065737728
    m_Localized: This perfect blue hue reminds me of the planet Tethys, where I recently
      traveled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478610031894528
    m_Localized: Dmitry Ivanovich, you took part in an expedition to Tethys?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478654546042880
    m_Localized: Yes, an amazing planet with endless oceans. I'd love to go back
      one day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478757247770624
    m_Localized: Young bear, have you ever wondered why the fountain restores health
      points?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478810905501696
    m_Localized: Quite often in games, especially fantasy ones, fountains or springs
      restore health!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478849828642816
    m_Localized: Hmm, interesting. A smart choice by the developers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478885346009088
    m_Localized: Water is the basis of life, Pasha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478918636199936
    m_Localized: Its role in chemistry is hard to overstate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 478954224869376
    m_Localized: And here, it seems its properties are just expressed in a different
      context.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479620095795200
    m_Localized: Every time after the fountain, I feel better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479656422662144
    m_Localized: It's a reminder of how important breaks are, Pasha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479693785522176
    m_Localized: Even in science, you need time to recover.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479775255683072
    m_Localized: Otherwise, there'll be no discoveries, no progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479845699018752
    m_Localized: "I see you\u2019re not giving up. That\u2019s commendable."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479884617965568
    m_Localized: But don't you think you're too fixated on small victories?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479917803298816
    m_Localized: Small victories matter too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479981632217088
    m_Localized: Ha, maybe. But real chemistry is always about reaching for more.
      Experience. Risk. Boundaries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480015585107968
    m_Localized: Don't listen to him, Pasha. Science is about order, not chaos!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480055129006080
    m_Localized: "What if chaos is just a form of order we haven\u2019t understood
      yet?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480182510018560
    m_Localized: "So, Pasha, have you realized yet that chemistry isn\u2019t just
      a game, but a true battle of minds?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480249866346496
    m_Localized: What the... Who are you?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480283198480384
    m_Localized: "Allow me to introduce myself. I\u2019m Arno. A genius, the creator
      of this game, and\u2014like it or not\u2014your new rival."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480711738908672
    m_Localized: Ha-ha. You lost on your own, entirely. I merely showed you what
      lies ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480778109575168
    m_Localized: Creator of the game? Did you rig it so I'd lose?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480997912076288
    m_Localized: But now I see you need... shall we say, a mentor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481044271718400
    m_Localized: "Arno, don\u2019t overestimate your importance. We managed just
      fine without you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481086260895744
    m_Localized: Ah, old friend. Still here, are you? You know I respect science
      too. I just see things differently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481125980954624
    m_Localized: "So what now? You\u2019re going to teach me how to play?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481188178288640
    m_Localized: "Not exactly. I\u2019ll observe, nudge, offer a few ideas. But learning\u2014that\u2019s
      up to you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481235443900416
    m_Localized: Careful, Pasha. This guy loves to twist things around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481283061833728
    m_Localized: "Oh, come on, Dmitry. Let\u2019s just call it a 'fun little experiment.'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481318235267072
    m_Localized: "Alright, since you\u2019re the creator, I\u2019ve got one question
      for you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481358387339264
    m_Localized: Why did you even create all this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481394525462528
    m_Localized: "Ah, Pasha, you don\u2019t get it! It\u2019s not weird\u2014it\u2019s
      fascinating!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481439798779904
    m_Localized: It was all created to challenge players, to make them think and
      seek answers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481521961000960
    m_Localized: What did the famous bioengineer Anatoly Myodchurin once say?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481698868355072
    m_Localized: "'A radish won\u2019t grow if you keep yanking it from the ground\u2014it\u2019ll
      just wither.'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481780791500800
    m_Localized: Seems like I need to give myself time too and stop charging ahead
      recklessly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 481816275312640
    m_Localized: "'A radish won\u2019t grow if you keep yanking it from the ground\u2014it\u2019ll
      just wither.'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482030218371072
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll get there\u2014as long as I keep trying new strategies,
      even if they\u2019re not what I expected."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482119632543744
    m_Localized: I thought you were a scientist here, not a stuntman.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482166801686528
    m_Localized: "Jumping into the same pit over and over\u2014that's brave, sure,
      but not exactly smart, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482214822273024
    m_Localized: Maybe instead of relying on luck, you should start analyzing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482269629243392
    m_Localized: Another defeat?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482318241226752
    m_Localized: Chemistry demands reason, not mindless play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482411677736960
    m_Localized: Back to the start again. Maybe this time it'll work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482450076590080
    m_Localized: "Though with my luck, that\u2019s questionable... Alright, time
      to focus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482701189570560
    m_Localized: Game overs are a way of learning too, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482755950403584
    m_Localized: "At least you\u2019ll remember what *not* to do."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482804482695168
    m_Localized: Now just figure out the right way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482873743237120
    m_Localized: "Pasha, you can\u2019t build a house without a foundation\u2014just
      like you can\u2019t succeed in this game without knowledge."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482922405552128
    m_Localized: Learn! Only science will lead you to victory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 482960082984960
    m_Localized: Maybe I should just try everything differently...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483005134004224
    m_Localized: I think I figured out where I messed up. Or... did I?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483064852504576
    m_Localized: If only I could collect all those compound recipes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483146989559808
    m_Localized: "Pasha, you\u2019re actually starting to amuse me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483194079010816
    m_Localized: How many times can you lose in the exact same spot?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483230049361920
    m_Localized: Maybe I should give you a hint?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483262924316672
    m_Localized: "Then again... no, that\u2019d be too easy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483313612480512
    m_Localized: "Losing is a lesson\u2014if you're willing to learn it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483353965879296
    m_Localized: "Come on, focus\u2014lean into the chemical compounds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483393094541312
    m_Localized: "They\u2019ll give you a big advantage!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483449264660480
    m_Localized: Here we are again. What is this, attempt number... what now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483488150052864
    m_Localized: "The key is not giving up\u2014even the greatest chemists didn\u2019t
      discover new laws on the first try!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483537059831808
    m_Localized: Your resilience, though? Still questionable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483610581786624
    m_Localized: You know, titanium is a tough metal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483683743031296
    m_Localized: "Come on, surprise me\u2014or we\u2019ll just keep going in circles."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483750738649088
    m_Localized: Draw conclusions, Pasha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483814617899008
    m_Localized: When a chemist makes a mistake, they analyze it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483847937449984
    m_Localized: "When a player loses... well, you know where I\u2019m going with
      this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483895152730112
    m_Localized: Science requires patience and calculation, not random poking around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483944020566016
    m_Localized: Try understanding the elements, not just shuffling them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484006389866496
    m_Localized: Alright, Pasha, quit whining. Pull yourself together!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484068301987840
    m_Localized: If I hear Arno say it's just a game one more time, I swear I'll
      say something back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484701763526656
    m_Localized: Dmitry Ivanovich, what is this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484782445158400
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m not exactly sure what to do with it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484812136636416
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s part of what you call a \u201Cgame.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484840754372608
    m_Localized: "I don\u2019t care much for this nonsense either, but still\u2014elements
      don\u2019t just combine randomly, even in this simulation, Pasha."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484904298078208
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve realized these so-called \u201Ccompounds\u201D might
      be your ace in the hole\u2014no matter how absurd this all seems."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484952209612800
    m_Localized: Read the recipes and create the compounds accordingly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 484991547990016
    m_Localized: So... it works like magic?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485025882562560
    m_Localized: "I still don\u2019t get how these compounds could actually be useful."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485084250497024
    m_Localized: "Magic? No, Pasha. This isn\u2019t magic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485151871066112
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s science. You\u2019ll need to grasp it to understand how
      these elements interact."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485212612976640
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll see for yourself once you start experimenting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485265679310848
    m_Localized: But for now, it may not make much sense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485302379470848
    m_Localized: When you're ready, the recipe will come in handy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485378602557440
    m_Localized: "A recipe for a compound\u2014it's like a magical tome!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485421636116480
    m_Localized: No, Pasha, not magic. It's science.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485458827010048
    m_Localized: Each formula is a key to how elements interact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485521909342208
    m_Localized: "But what if I don\u2019t have the elements needed for the recipe?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485575353163776
    m_Localized: Then you search. In chemistry, it all starts with the right materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485610249773056
    m_Localized: Even rare elements can be found if you're persistent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485718525730816
    m_Localized: These recipes make me feel like an alchemist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485761274077184
    m_Localized: "Alchemy was the forerunner of chemistry. You\u2019re on the right
      path."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485829922250752
    m_Localized: Dmitry Ivanovich, are real-life chemistry recipes this simple?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485870187569152
    m_Localized: "Pasha, in real chemistry, these \u201Crecipes\u201D are much more
      complicated."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485902622121984
    m_Localized: "But the core idea is the same\u2014you need to know the basics."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485932372320256
    m_Localized: And if you learn it here, maybe you'll be ready for real experiments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 485971584868352
    m_Localized: "But don\u2019t forget\u2014this is a game, not a laboratory."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486051880624128
    m_Localized: The more I study the recipes, the less they scare me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486101457297408
    m_Localized: "You\u2019re starting to see patterns, not chaos."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486141848444928
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s exactly what separates a scientist from a beginner."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486207891955712
    m_Localized: I already have so many different recipes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486260173955072
    m_Localized: I feel like I already know everything I need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486309301837824
    m_Localized: "A good scientist never says, \u201CI know everything.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486342541697024
    m_Localized: "Instead, they say, \u201CI\u2019m ready to keep learning.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486438192799744
    m_Localized: "Is this the next level? Looks like it\u2019s going to be tougher
      than the last one."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486504886427648
    m_Localized: Just like in chemistry, each stage is harder than the last. Be ready
      for new challenges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486553510993920
    m_Localized: You?! You're the final boss?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486658301485056
    m_Localized: Congratulations, Pasha. You've made it to the very end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486725611675648
    m_Localized: "Who else? Didn\u2019t you suspect I was preparing you for this
      very moment all along?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486767328223232
    m_Localized: Arno, have you been testing him like a lab rat?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486841525460992
    m_Localized: Not exactly, old friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486876531122176
    m_Localized: I gave him challenges, dropped hints, let him learn from mistakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486909565460480
    m_Localized: "And look at what he\u2019s become! Aren\u2019t you proud?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486941970653184
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m ready to defeat you and prove I wasn\u2019t just a toy
      in your hands all along!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486986543521792
    m_Localized: "A billion points to you! That\u2019s what I was waiting for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487026536210432
    m_Localized: "But don\u2019t forget, Pasha, I\u2019m not just the final boss."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487080474959872
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m the embodiment of your knowledge, your mistakes, and your
      victories."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487120417316864
    m_Localized: Pasha, remember everything you've learned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487158417711104
    m_Localized: "Arno\u2019s strong, but you\u2019ve got a few tricks up your sleeve
      too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487210775207936
    m_Localized: "Haha, we\u2019ll see. May the best one win!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487320494006272
    m_Localized: "Looks like we\u2019ve come a long way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487384712994816
    m_Localized: Ha, and this is just the beginning, Pasha!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487423061516288
    m_Localized: "Remember: the point isn\u2019t just to reach the finish line, but
      to understand how you got there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487458931204096
    m_Localized: "A samurai has no goal\u2014only the path!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487494888972288
    m_Localized: "Haha! I see human culture isn\u2019t lost on you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487573574115328
    m_Localized: "Well, Arno, looks like I\u2019ve won."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487650225020928
    m_Localized: Why did you even create this game, this world of chemistry and elements?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487687554326528
    m_Localized: I always wanted something more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 487719095492608
    m_Localized: "Not just to teach bears chemistry\u2014but to show it\u2019s not
      as boring as people think."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488013569187840
    m_Localized: Games can teach us how not-so-obvious things can interact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488045781442560
    m_Localized: "Chemistry isn\u2019t just a set of reactions, it\u2019s an art."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488094129184768
    m_Localized: And art is always full of surprises.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488127192883200
    m_Localized: Art, you say?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488168557109248
    m_Localized: "I thought chemistry was an exact science, but here\u2026 strange
      elements and unexpected reactions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488212727324672
    m_Localized: "Well, you\u2019ve already realized that sometimes a precise answer
      isn\u2019t what matters most."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488249238740992
    m_Localized: "Sometimes it\u2019s about sensing how things work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488281677488128
    m_Localized: You need to understand not just theory, but how it all connects
      in real life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488319002599424
    m_Localized: I get it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488352095657984
    m_Localized: "Sometimes things really aren\u2019t as obvious as they seem."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488385293574144
    m_Localized: "Exactly. And you\u2019ve learned that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488420341178368
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m proud to have helped you see chemistry from another perspective."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488498225209344
    m_Localized: "But remember, Pasha \u2014 everything you\u2019ve learned is just
      the beginning."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488549576073216
    m_Localized: The world of chemistry is much bigger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488598129336320
    m_Localized: I do understand that games can be fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488663195574272
    m_Localized: "But still, chemistry isn\u2019t just a game."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488723828432896
    m_Localized: It demands a serious mindset and discipline.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488769600872448
    m_Localized: "However, as you rightly said, Pasha, sometimes it\u2019s important
      to look at things from a different angle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488823908720640
    m_Localized: "Maybe that\u2019s where part of the truth lies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488870427746304
    m_Localized: Yes, I think I understand now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488915021586432
    m_Localized: Not everything always has to be complex and precise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 488964866695168
    m_Localized: "Sometimes it\u2019s just important to understand why things work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489012321050624
    m_Localized: You sure have a funny way of putting things, Pasha!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489059137871872
    m_Localized: "There\u2019s a wise spark rattling around in that skull of yours."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489103119343616
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s important to see the big picture."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489153262247936
    m_Localized: "Maybe you\u2019re right, Arno."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489198925635584
    m_Localized: "But Pasha, I hope you haven\u2019t forgotten that discipline and
      patience are what truly matter in any science."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489246749089792
    m_Localized: "Let this be more than just a game to you \u2014 let it be a lesson."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489318270361600
    m_Localized: Thank you both.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489358405656576
    m_Localized: "There\u2019s still a lot I don\u2019t know, but I\u2019ll keep
      learning."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489412155662336
    m_Localized: Hey hey, hold on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 489460788617216
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t forget, I, the great genius Arno, would be glad to throw
      a new challenge your way!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 610002684043264
