  - m_Id: 628958090190848
    m_Localized: Dmitry Ivanovich
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629137547681792
    m_Localized: Pasha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629492201250816
    m_Localized: Shatun the warlock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629698191908864
    m_Localized: Player
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629771399290880
    m_Localized: Epic enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629854396178432
    m_Localized: Youth experimenter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630013557432320
    m_Localized: Shatun the major
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630215316037632
    m_Localized: Shatun the cardsman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630325936611328
    m_Localized: Robo-Shatun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630425740075008
    m_Localized: Shatun the panda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630504429412352
    m_Localized: Awaken warlock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630589699612672
    m_Localized: Legendary enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630737896955904
    m_Localized: Shatun the warrior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630851411599360
    m_Localized: Shatun the nature
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631004700827648
    m_Localized: Shatun the elementalyst
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631114386071552
    m_Localized: Shatun the assasin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631197726892032
    m_Localized: Shatun the exolosioner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631306447446016
    m_Localized: Shatun the young
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631413691604992
    m_Localized: Shy Shatun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 632957614907392
    m_Localized: Battle end
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 681523838410752
    m_Localized: Place cards on the game board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 682145966940160
    m_Localized: End your turn, and the cards on the board will automatically attack
      the opponent in front of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 682455938588672
    m_Localized: "To win, reduce the opponent\u2019s health to zero."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 682592857448448
    m_Localized: If there is no opposing card, your card will deal damage directly
      to the enemy character.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 682778145021952
    m_Localized: 'Cards have special effects.

      Explore and experiment with
      them to discover what each one does!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683061411536896
    m_Localized: 'To play cards, you need Electrons.

      At the start of each
      turn, you gain 2 Electrons.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683334909517824
    m_Localized: "A card\u2019s cost equals the number of electrons on the element\u2019s
      outer shell."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683603596632064
    m_Localized: "Add the numbers after the orbital letters \u2014 that\u2019s the
      card\u2019s cost."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683711981641728
    m_Localized: 'Cost: 1'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683940986445824
    m_Localized: 'Cost: 6'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 684126492123136
    m_Localized: 'Cost: 11'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 684262022668288
    m_Localized: When an element card is destroyed, you collect electrons on your
      orbitals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 684388963278848
    m_Localized: "You gain as many electrons as the card\u2019s cost."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 684570492755968
    m_Localized: 'The more electrons on your orbitals, the higher your Electron Level.

      <b>Each
      level grants +2 electrons per turn.</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 684825229615104
    m_Localized: "To play a card, it's not enough to just have the required number
      of electrons \u2014\r\nyou also need a sufficient Electron Level."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685026283577344
    m_Localized: If your level is equal to or higher than the card's level, you can
      play it by spending the required number of electrons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685132449800192
    m_Localized: "You can determine a card\u2019s level by the highest number before
      the orbital letters in its electron configuration."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685268336861184
    m_Localized: "El. Level \u2013 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685376059170816
    m_Localized: "El. Level \u2013 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685457688715264
    m_Localized: "El. Level \u2013 5"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 686715354963968
    m_Localized: "Combine elements to create new Compound cards \u2014 your key to
      victory."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 686811303862272
    m_Localized: They can be used at any time in battle and cost no Electrons!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 686952345722880
    m_Localized: "Metals are marked with a gray border.\r\n\r\nNonmetals \u2014 with
      a yellow one.\r\n\r\nHydrogen, though a nonmetal, is an exception.\r\nIt\u2019s
      marked with a dark border."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 687063968735232
    m_Localized: "Collect recipes!\r\n\r\nThey stay in your inventory throughout
      the entire game and aren\u2019t lost after defeat.\r\n\r\nRecipes show the
      required elements and the unique effects of the resulting compound."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 731143130013696
    m_Localized: Welcome to Element Arno!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 731370780057600
    m_Localized: This is your game board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 731491672481792
    m_Localized: "Here\u2019s the table where you\u2019ll play your cards."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 731603849142272
    m_Localized: "And this is your hand \u2014 the cards you can use."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 731750968549376
    m_Localized: "Play any card onto the board! \u2014 waiting for action"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 731966807433216
    m_Localized: Each card has attack and health values, and requires a certain amount
      of Electrons to play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 732068187955200
    m_Localized: "The card\u2019s cost is equal to the number of electrons on its
      outer shell."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 732165298675712
    m_Localized: "Just add the numbers after the letters in its electron configuration
      \u2014 that\u2019s the cost!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 732256067608576
    m_Localized: "To end your turn, press \u201CEnd Turn\u201D \u2014 waiting for
      action"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 732384748855296
    m_Localized: Waiting for the opponent's turn to end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 732560200785920
    m_Localized: At the start of each of your turns, you gain Electrons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 732675019857920
    m_Localized: The amount of electrons depends on your Electron Level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 732839528849408
    m_Localized: You can raise your Electron Level by destroying cards on the board
      or investing electrons into upgrading it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 732946835922944
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ve drawn a \u201CSilicon\u201D card, but can\u2019t play
      it until your Electron Level reaches 3 \u2014 the card\u2019s required level."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 733060858077184
    m_Localized: "You can tell a card\u2019s level by the highest number before the
      orbital letters in its electron configuration."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 733196321513472
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll give you some electrons \u2014 spend them all to raise
      your level!\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 733299400728576
    m_Localized: Great! Now you can play Silicon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 733485128704000
    m_Localized: "If your hand is low on cards and you want more \u2014 click the
      deck."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 733725160333312
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll draw a card, but it costs 2 electrons."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 733854533640192
    m_Localized: "Cards have many effects \u2014 study them to win more effectively!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 733950193131520
    m_Localized: "To win, reduce the opponent\u2019s hero\u2019s health to 0."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 734041058533376
    m_Localized: "If there\u2019s no enemy card in front of yours \u2014 it will
      deal damage directly to the opponent\u2019s hero."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 734130955051008
    m_Localized: Good luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 742771833659392
    m_Localized: Here you can create unique Compound cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 742882437455872
    m_Localized: They can be used once per battle, but will return in the next one!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 742997181030400
    m_Localized: 'Collect recipes as you play or come up with your own.

      But
      remember:

      Compounds can only be created from two different types of
      cards.

      You can''t create something that doesn''t exist in nature!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 743078928015360
    m_Localized: For example, to create water, you need two Hydrogen and one Oxygen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 743192362967040
    m_Localized: "Place two Hydrogen cards on top, one Oxygen on the bottom, and
      press \u201CCreate\u201D!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1787987374071808
    m_Localized: Surrender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
